  "uuid": "eb877d75-a7a5-4ac6-bcae-b981ee1fb109",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "7f4640a9-de6f-c80c-cdaa-a294d7fa064a",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "5fba32f4-9436-3719-74f8-1a13dc9018e6",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "These ambassadors will play a pivotal role in bridging the gap between students and faculty, advocating for student needs, and leading initiatives that contribute to the overall vibrancy of the campus.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Furthermore, the AKU-ISMC Student Ambassador Scheme provides students with a myriad of opportunities to engage in extracurricular activities, community service projects, and collaborative research efforts. By immersing themselves in these experiences, students have the chance to broaden their perspectives, develop new interests, and build lasting connections with their peers and mentors.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The launch event saw a high level of enthusiasm from attendees, it is poised to become a hallmark of the AKU-ISMC experience, shaping the next generation of leaders who will make meaningful contributions to their communities and beyond.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
