    "show_share": true,
    "description": "London, February 20, 2024 - The Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC) marked a historic moment on February 20th with the official launch of its Student Ambassador Scheme. Hosted at the AKU-ISMC campus in London, the event unveiled an innovative initiative set to redefine student engagement by inspiring individuals to take on ambassadorial roles and explore diverse opportunities within their academic pursuits.",
